From 5d36d6fc8ddf426c8f3c4f843feb8f93a0fd19a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joshua <joshua@exabit.io>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 14:55:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/16] ggml-cuda: mul_mat_id sync predicate uses the
 MUL_MAT_ID batch window (MMVQ_MMID_MAX_BATCH_SIZE)

The gfx906 MMVQ change widened the dense MMVQ window to 16 columns and kept
MUL_MAT_ID at 8 (MMVQ_MMID_MAX_BATCH_SIZE), but ggml_cuda_mul_mat_id_needs_sync
still tested dst->ne[2] against MMVQ_MAX_BATCH_SIZE. For a non-quantized expert
product with 9-16 tokens on AMD the predicate answered "no sync" while the
dispatch fell through to the sorted path: GGML_ASSERT at ggml-cuda.cu:2727,
test-backend-ops -o MUL_MAT_ID. Found by tools/gfx906-master-validate.sh.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N36nSaJm4MzytJeS8H91zW
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda.cu | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda.cu b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda.cu
index 3cb10524e..6b426fa16 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda.cu
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda.cu
@@ -2656,7 +2656,10 @@ static bool ggml_cuda_mul_mat_id_needs_sync(const ggml_tensor * dst, const int c
         return true;
     }
 
-    if (dst->ne[2] <= MMVQ_MAX_BATCH_SIZE) {
+    // MUL_MAT_ID keeps the upstream 8-column MMVQ/MMVF window (MMVQ_MMID_MAX_BATCH_SIZE); the dense path is 16 wide on gfx906.
+    // The predicate must mirror the dispatch in ggml_cuda_mul_mat_id, or a 9-16-token f16/bf16 expert product on AMD is
+    // predicted "no sync" and then falls through to the sorted path (assert in test-backend-ops MUL_MAT_ID).
+    if (dst->ne[2] <= MMVQ_MMID_MAX_BATCH_SIZE) {
         if (ggml_is_quantized(src0->type)) {
             if (dst->ne[2] <= get_mmvq_mmid_max_batch(src0->type, cc)) {
                 return false;
